@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
title Rover ANPR — data flow (implemented system)

actor "External API consumer / browser" as consumer
rectangle "Hikvision\nlive RTSP" as camera
rectangle "Local video file\nsequential replay with video PTS" as file
rectangle "Camera process" {
  rectangle "OpenCV capture\nlatest-frame-only for live" as capture
  rectangle "YOLO26n (CUDA)\nboxes + detection confidence" as yolo
  rectangle "OCR (CUDA)\ntext, subtype, confidence" as ocr
  rectangle "RF plate format +\nOCR confidence filter" as validate
  rectangle "Tracking + weighted voting\n3 of 5 observations; change 7 of 10" as confirm
  rectangle "Relative position + crop quality\ncenter offset + LEFT/CENTER/RIGHT" as position
  rectangle "EventSender\nbounded queue + retries" as sender
  rectangle "Preview / optional diagnostics" as preview
}
rectangle "FastAPI\n/plates /history /health\n/live /live/frame /live/status\n/live/stream /live/diagnostics\n/captures" as api
database "SQLite" as db
folder "Shared captures volume\nJPEG snapshots + atomic preview files" as storage

camera --> capture : decoded full-size frames
file --> capture : every frame, no live skipping
capture --> yolo : original-resolution frame\nexisting JPEG input adapter
yolo --> ocr : cropped detected plates
ocr --> validate : intermediate OCR hypotheses
validate --> position : readable + confidence >= 0.85\ncivilian RF format, box and source size
position --> confirm : candidate, center, position, confidence, quality
confirm --> sender : session_id, event_id, track_id\nplate, confidence, quality, position\ndistance_m=null, optional image_path
sender --> api : POST /plates (confirmed events)
confirm --> storage : best frame snapshots
capture --> preview : fresh frames independent of inference
ocr --> preview : current hypotheses + boxes\nnot only confirmed labels
confirm --> preview : confirmation state
preview --> storage : latest bounded JPEG / diagnostics
storage --> api : shared-file read + snapshot serving
api --> db : plate, confidence, detected_at, image_path\ntrack/quality bookkeeping + event deduplication
api --> consumer : current confirmed results / history\npreview, diagnostics, snapshots
consumer --> api : HTTP requests

note bottom of db
Coordinates and boxes are NOT persisted in SQLite.
position exists in current /plates results;
boxes and OCR hypotheses exist in preview/diagnostics.
History timestamp is API receipt time, not video PTS.
end note
note bottom of capture
No ONVIF archive retrieval, ROS2 or QR docking implemented.
Live drops old frames; file replay waits for each processed frame.
end note
@enduml
